  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">List Cultures (2025), published by Taylor & Francis, has been cited 1 time. Beyond that, it is used in teaching.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">List Cultures by Liam Young was published by Taylor & Francis in 2025. Conceptually, the work connects to German, Materialism, Key (lock), Sociology and Media studies.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 1 citation. Notable citing venues include Revista Galega de Filolox\u00eda. They come from 2 countries, led by Spain and Portugal.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">In teaching, it is listed in 1 open course syllabus. Its subject matter aligns with Quality Education among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
